  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\because \\operatorname{tr}(A)=3 \\text { and }|A|=\\frac{1}{2}$\nNow, $B=\\operatorname{adj}(\\operatorname{adj}(2 A))=|2 A|^{3-2} \\cdot(2 A)$\n$=2^3|A| \\cdot 2 A=8 A$\n$\\begin{aligned} & \\therefore \\operatorname{tr}(B)=8 \\operatorname{tr}(A)=24 \\\\ & \\text { and }|B|=|8 A|=8^3 \\cdot \\frac{1}{2}=256 \\\\ & \\therefore \\quad \\operatorname{trace}(B)+|B|=24+256\\end{aligned}$\n$=280$",
    "image": null
  },
